$* bracketPML / reorder - probe: swap two members with REORDER and roll back.
$* Stand on the FIRST member of an owner that has at least two members. Paste as Macro.
$* Do not SAVEWORK while it runs.
MARKDB |bracketPML reorder probe|
VAR !!bpmlA REF
NEXT
VAR !!bpmlB REF
VAR !!bpmlO OWNER
REORDER $!!bpmlB BEFORE $!!bpmlA
$!!bpmlO
$P expected: the first two members have swapped places
Q MEM
UNDODB
$P after UNDODB the original order is back:
Q MEM
